---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — How Xi'an Guide Handles Your Data" description="How Xi'an Guide collects, uses, and protects your information. No cookies, no analytics, no personal data collection — just honest, transparent travel advice." noindex>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 md:px-6 pt-12 pb-20">
    

    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Our Approach</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Xi'an Guide does not collect, store, track, or share any personal information about our visitors. We believe travel guides should help you plan your trip — not harvest your data. Here is exactly how we handle the small amount of information that passes through our site.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">What We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="lucide:check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-600" stroke-width="1.5" /><span><strong>No cookies.</strong> We do not set any cookies on your device — not for analytics, not for preferences, not for advertising.</span></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="lucide:check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-600" stroke-width="1.5" /><span><strong>No analytics.</strong> We do not use Google Analytics, Matomo, Plausible, or any other tracking service. We have no idea how many people visit this site — and we are fine with that.</span></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="lucide:check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-600" stroke-width="1.5" /><span><strong>No advertising trackers.</strong> We run zero ads. There are no Facebook pixels, no Google Ads tags, and no retargeting scripts on this site.</span></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="lucide:check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-600" stroke-width="1.5" /><span><strong>No IP logging.</strong> Our hosting provider may keep standard server access logs for security and operational purposes, but we do not access, analyze, or retain those logs ourselves. We never associate them with individual visitors.</span></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="lucide:check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-emerald-600" stroke-width="1.5" /><span><strong>No personal data collection.</strong> We do not ask for your name, email, or any other personal information. There are no sign-up forms, no newsletter subscriptions, and no user accounts on this site.</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Email Communication</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">When you email us at <a href="mailto:hello@xi-an-china.com" class="text-terracotta-600 hover:text-terracotta-700 underline">hello@xi-an-china.com</a>, we receive your email address and whatever information you choose to include in the message. Here is what happens with it:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
        <li>We use your email only to respond to your message. Nothing else.</li>
        <li>We never add your address to a mailing list or newsletter — we do not have one.</li>
        <li>We never share your email or message with third parties.</li>
        <li>We delete email threads after the conversation is complete and no follow-up is needed.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Affiliate & Sponsorship Transparency</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">This site contains <strong>zero affiliate links</strong>. We do not earn commissions from hotel bookings, ticket sales, restaurant visits, or any product recommendation. Every price on this site — from Terracotta Warriors tickets ($18) to biangbiang noodles ($2-$4) — is listed because we want you to budget accurately, not because we profit from the listing. We do not accept sponsored content, paid reviews, or freebies from any business we write about.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">External Links</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Our pages link to other websites for your convenience — official attraction sites, transport operators, and trusted travel resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external sites. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies before sharing any personal information with them.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">This site is a general-audience travel guide. We do not knowingly collect any information from children under 13. Since we do not collect any personal information at all, this is a natural outcome of our approach rather than a special policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Policy Updates</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">If our privacy practices change, we will update this page and note the date of the change. Because our approach is to collect nothing, significant changes are unlikely. The last update to this policy was in August 2026, coinciding with our site launch.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Questions about this privacy policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@xi-an-china.com" class="text-terracotta-600 hover:text-terracotta-700 underline">hello@xi-an-china.com</a>. We will respond within 48 hours. For other questions about the site, see our <a href="/contact" class="text-terracotta-600 hover:text-terracotta-700 underline">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-stone-200 text-center">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-all hover:border-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-50 active:scale-[0.98] no-underline">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
